{{Han etyl}}
In the oracle bone script, {{zh-l|*母|mother}} was borrowed to represent this character. It was later specialized to distinguish it from “mother”, replacing the two dots with one stroke.

===Etymology===
Cognate with {{och-l|無|to not have}}. Already in Zhou time, phonetically confused with and read like {{och-l|無}}.

Cognate with {{zh-l|*唔}} in {{cog|yue|-}}, {{cog|nan-tws|-}} and {{cog|hak|-}}.

